Core Business Objectives
Spend Visibility: Compare actual procurement spend against target budgets to identify overspending and track monthly variations.

Supplier Performance & Risk Control: Assess supplier reliability, lead times, quality ratings, and risk metrics.

Logistics & Delivery Optimization: Monitor On-Time Delivery (OTD), track carrier performance, identify delivery delay drivers, and analyze freight transport modes.

🛠️ Data Architecture & Modeling
1. Data Cleaning & Transformation (Power Query)
Combined multi-source operational tables (procurement logs, target spreadsheets, supplier rating databases, carrier information, and shipment records).

Utilized Append and Merge operations to unite disparate historical logs and normalize dimension attributes.

Standardized inconsistent categorical data (payment terms, transport modes, shipment statuses) and applied explicit text trimming and numeric rounding.

Dynamic unpivoting of target matrices into tidy fact structures.

2. Advanced Modeling (Galaxy Schema)
Designed a dynamic Galaxy Schema containing dual fact tables (Procurement Actuals & Procurement Targets) sharing common dimension tables (Dim Supplier, Dim Product, Dim Warehouse, Dim Carrier, Dim Buyer, and Dim Category).

Developed a dedicated, fully continuous DAX Calendar/Date Table (Dim Date) supporting both active and inactive relationships (USERELATIONSHIP) for multidate analysis (Order Date, Actual Delivery Date, Promise Date, and Dispatch Date).

📊 Key Metrics & DAX Measures
Procurement Financials: Actual Procurement Spend, Target Spend, Spend Variance, and Month-over-Month (MoM) Growth calculations.

Operational Volume & Quality: Total Purchase Orders (PO), Total Delivered Shipments, Rejection Rate (%).

Delivery & Fulfillment: On-Time Delivery (OTD %), Average Lead Time (Days), Delayed Shipments.

Dynamic Indicators: Custom DAX visual indicators (green/red variance trend arrows) reflecting month-over-month shifts.

🖥️ Dashboard Features & Visualizations
Executive KPI Panel: At-a-glance cards showing total spend, order volumes, lead times, and rejection rates alongside MoM percentage variance.

Financial Performance: Interactive Actual vs. Target Spend comparison and Spend Variance by Product Category.

Risk & Order Status: Breakdown of order statuses (Open, Closed, Canceled) and supplier distribution by risk tier (Low, Medium, High).

Root-Cause Delay Analysis: Dynamic Decomposition Tree breaking down delivery delays across transport modes, carrier names, regions, and product lines.

Interactivity & Navigation: Date range pickers, multi-level slicers (Month, Supplier Name), and streamlined side-navigation buttons.
